## SQ-CS-06 | crop_seasons.json edit + /reload moves wheat (run last: /reload truncates the KubeJS log)
shell python3 -c "import json;p='kubejs/generation_scripts/worldgen/crop_seasons.json';d=json.load(open(p));b=d['blocks'];b['temperate'].remove('minecraft:wheat');b['cold'].append('minecraft:wheat');json.dump(d,open(p,'w'),indent=2)"
> reload
sleep 20
> execute if block 30 -60 30 #creativeengineering:crop_seasons/cold
> execute if block 30 -60 30 #creativeengineering:crop_seasons/temperate
shell cp "$INST/kubejs/generation_scripts/worldgen/crop_seasons.json" kubejs/generation_scripts/worldgen/crop_seasons.json
expect Test passed
expect Test failed
look the shell step restored the instance file in srv; /reload again before any later season row

